FINAL ANSWER:
**Short answer:** Troy Goode created `lib/index.js` and still owns most of it. The plain `blame` result is misleading. It credits "Fiona Formatter" with 89.9% of lines, but that is only the 2026-04-12 reformat commit (`62628c0`, 214 lines changed, 4-space indent and double quotes).

I re-ran `git blame -w -M -C --ignore-rev 62628c0 --ignore-rev b2005d9`. That ignores the reformat and the 2026-04-10 `lib: annotate handlers` commit (`b2005d9`, 12 lines, also by Troy Goode). It gives the ownership below.

**Who is in the file today (238 lines)**

| Author | Lines | Share |
|---|---|---|
| Troy Goode | 157 | 66% |
| Douglas Christopher Wilson | 22 | 9% |
| Alejandro Caravaca Puchades | 12 | 5% |
